{"id":"5969","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5969_main_cirrostratus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在照片顶部，通过积雨云顶扩散而形成的一层有阴影的厚<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>向下风方大幅延伸。</p>\n<p>在地平线方向可看到大范围的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状降水性鬃积雨云</span>单体，前面是一长列<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>。在这行云上有不同发展阶段的积状云；在南端，充分发展出角塔，可确定为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。</p>\n<p>在此之前的2.5小时，雷暴夹雨掠过机场上空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Victor Oviedo","location":"阿根廷，科尔多瓦，科隆县","latitude":"纬度: 31° 11' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 64° 7' 48'' W","date":"07 November 2014 1433 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.10"}]}]}